OnBorrowCallbackTest
├── given caller market is not supported
│   └── it should revert
└── given caller market is supported
    ├── when swap fails
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when swap succeeds but amountOut is less than minAmountOut
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when swap succeeds and amountOut meets minAmountOut
        ├── when there are no leftover sell tokens
        │   └── it should add collateral to market
        └── when there are leftover sell tokens
            └── it should transfer leftover tokens to onBehalf and add collateral to market 